00:19:05.102 --> 00:19:06.399
You took Tsubasa?!

00:19:06.903 --> 00:19:10.930
Where we are headed, things such as
salvation have no place!

00:19:11.174 --> 00:19:13.005
Then why do you fight?

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.879
There is no longer any reason.

00:19:15.879 --> 00:19:19.337
I have become almighty, and control all things.

00:19:19.916 --> 00:19:21.110
What happened to Tsubasa?

00:19:21.318 --> 00:19:22.012
Ah.

00:19:24.087 --> 00:19:28.854
As you can see, she is functioning just fine
as the Magdalene of Thunder.

00:19:30.327 --> 00:19:35.924
Now that I have become one with this girl, I can
intuit all phenomena using numerical values.

00:19:44.274 --> 00:19:47.072
Yes, even those of the flesh.

00:19:52.516 --> 00:19:55.451
You bastard!

00:19:55.752 --> 00:19:57.151
Lord Wang-Chen.

00:19:57.254 --> 00:19:57.879
Tsubasa!

00:20:01.458 --> 00:20:02.925
You fool!

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:07.157
I told you that Tsubasa Amano's
consciousness is now mine!

00:20:15.805 --> 00:20:17.796
Wang-Chen!

00:20:25.282 --> 00:20:28.115
So there's nothing I can do?

00:20:28.618 --> 00:20:32.255
The love and kindness I previously knew...

00:20:32.255 --> 00:20:33.847
are powerless?

00:20:34.791 --> 00:20:37.851
It was all a mistake?

00:20:39.462 --> 00:20:40.952
I want you to tell me.

00:20:42.465 --> 00:20:43.591
Please tell me!

00:20:44.334 --> 00:20:47.963
You, who taught me my heart.

00:20:52.042 --> 00:20:54.602
Mafuyu!

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:12.157
Honestly. I could hear you without
raising your voice like that.

00:21:14.431 --> 00:21:17.059
Every time I see you, you're all cuts and bruises.

00:21:20.604 --> 00:21:22.003
You two-faced brat.

00:21:25.442 --> 00:21:26.568
Mafuyu!

00:21:48.398 --> 00:21:54.804
Unstable, an asymmetrical trajectory

00:21:54.804 --> 00:22:01.311
Irises shaded in prelude

00:22:01.311 --> 00:22:07.584
The light's terminal line remains distorted

00:22:07.584 --> 00:22:13.181
And deceives the visualized dream

00:22:15.058 --> 00:22:20.430
In that dark, fictional abyss

00:22:20.430 --> 00:22:26.503
Someday, smash through the imprisoned world

00:22:26.503 --> 00:22:28.471
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:28.471 --> 00:22:30.140
And you will die in your sin

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:33.343
Slice the cross, is the voice that recites

00:22:33.343 --> 00:22:36.980
A poem of awakening to an absent god

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:39.816
The blade of sacrilege?

00:22:39.816 --> 00:22:41.418
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:41.418 --> 00:22:43.086
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:43.086 --> 00:22:46.823
An oratorio with you, who have been cut off

00:22:46.823 --> 00:22:49.693
Sorrow is illuminated by the moon

00:22:49.693 --> 00:22:55.290
An eve that leads to a sparkling blue tomorrow

00:23:09.946 --> 00:23:10.947
Next Episode

00:23:10.947 --> 00:23:12.215
Sasha, it's been a while.

00:23:12.215 --> 00:23:14.818
Mafuyu! How did you?

00:23:14.818 --> 00:23:18.288
To hear that would bring tears.
To speak of it, the tearful details would...

00:23:18.288 --> 00:23:20.824
More importantly, the witchcraft!

00:23:20.824 --> 00:23:21.458
Huh?

00:23:21.458 --> 00:23:24.950
I will sacrifice no one. I'll save everything!

00:23:25.161 --> 00:23:27.630
Next time on Qwaser of Stigmata II,
"Reunion."

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:29.699
Reunion

00:23:29.699 --> 00:23:32.602
Tremble! Kneel down in fear!

00:23:32.602 --> 00:23:33.169
Reunion

00:23:33.169 --> 00:23:34.830
That wasn't even a preview!
